[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "イザナイザナ！\u3000今回は何をするのでありまするか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana, Izana! What are we doing today?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "クールなアイドルに激ニガの水を飲ませてみたー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're making a cool idol drink super-bitter water!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パチパチパチー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooooh!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ということで、こちらは錬金術士の友達に\n作ってもらった特製のにが～い水だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So! This here is a specially made ultra-bitter water, courtesy of my alchemist friend!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "見たところ無色透明。匂いもありませぬ。\nこれはヨハナも気付けないでありましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Colorless and clear. No smell either. There's no way Johanna will notice!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そしてこっちには、今しがた激しいダンスレッスンを\n終えたヨハナがいるよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And over there is Johanna, who just finished an intense dance lesson!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっとゴクリといっちゃうことでしょう！\nどんなリアクションをするか楽しみだなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's bound to down it in one gulp! I can't wait to see her reaction!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼でござるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You are wicked."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃ、行くよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Okay, here we go!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナー、お疲れさま！\u3000お水持って来たよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna! Great work out there! I brought you some water!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "気が利くじゃない。助かるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How thoughtful. Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ん？\u3000何を撮ってるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Hm? What are you filming?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レッスンの合間のプライベートタイムを撮ってるんだー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just a little behind-the-scenes footage between lessons!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふうん……そんなものをみんな見たいの？\nまあ、ご自由に",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm... people actually want to see that? Well, suit yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ごく……！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "*gulp*...!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "がはっ、げほっ……にがっ！！\u3000何よこれ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Blech, gah—it's BITTER!! What is this?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "テッテレー！\u3000ドッキリ、大成功！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ta-daaaa! Gotcha!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ/鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana/Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "テッテレー！\u3000ドッキリ、大成功！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ta-daaaa! Gotcha!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "不要",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Passerby"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ドッキリ……？\u3000もしかして、わざと苦い水を？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gotcha...? Wait—did you give me bitter water on purpose?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "面白いリアクションを見せてくれるかなって思って",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We were hoping for a fun reaction!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よくもハメたわね……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You little—I can't believe you set me up...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃー、許して～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahh, mercy, mercy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら、待ちなさい！\u3000絶対あんたにも飲ませる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Get back here! You're drinking this too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんか、あの子雰囲気変わった？\u3000おかげで、\n前よりユニットにまとまりがあるように感じるよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Has that girl's vibe changed? The unit feels more put-together than before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、わたくしもそう思いますわ。しかし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It does, doesn't it. Though..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何がきっかけで変わったのでしょう？\n本当、若者の成長はあっという間ですわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What do you suppose brought about the change? The young really do grow up in the blink of an eye."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ララ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]